# Plots

A first-order low-pass filter: its gain against frequency, on log axes.

```calc
f_c := 100 Hz
G(f) := 1/sqrt(1 + (f/f_c)^2)
```

```plot {#p1 w=420 h=260}
title: Low-pass filter
x: f = 1 Hz .. 100 kHz
x_unit: Hz
samples: 300
traces:
  - y: G(f)
    label: Gain
axes:
  x: { log: true }
  y: { log: true, min: 0.001 }
```

An ellipse, as a parametric curve: each trace can have its own x.

```calc
a := 3 m
b := 2 m
```

```plot {#p2 w=300 h=240}
title: Ellipse
x: t = 0 .. 2*π
traces:
  - x: a*cos(t)
    y: b*sin(t)
    label: Ellipse
axes:
  x: { step: 1 }
  y: { step: 1 }
```
